	(text "12V IN -> F1 3A PTC -> Q1 reverse-polarity PFET (D6 clamps Vgs) -> +12V\nD7 SMAJ15A TVS on +12V (15V standoff, clamps ~24V: under the TPS5430 36V max)\nU6 TPS5430: +12V -> +5V buck, 3A, 500kHz. R29/R30 15k/4.7k -> 5.12V. L2 15uH (FXL0840-150-M), D8 SS34 catch diode, C36 10nF boot\nAll-ceramic output (C37 C38 C48 C49) -> compensation per TI datasheet Fig 7-11: C52 1nF across R29, C53 100pF and C54 100nF + R39 330R from VSENSE to GND\nU6 EN left open (internal pull-up, 5.3V UVLO). TI: never connect EN to GND through a resistor\nU9 AMS1117-3.3: +5V -> +3.3V LDO (C50 in, C51 out; ~0.5W at 0.3A)\nLayout: keep the C35 -> VIN -> PowerPAD GND and PH -> D8 loops tiny; PowerPAD vias to In1 GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120 75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4b3c4b0-0ea0-48c9-b359-34e2d933c549")
	)
